BT 1 0 0 1 0 61 Tm /F1 9 Tf 14 TL 18 0 Td (The framework consists of eight sequential gates, each of which must be passed before the next is attempted.) Tj T* -18 0 Td (A failure at any gate terminates the analysis. The gates are ordered to maximise the efficiency of the) Tj T* (disqualification process: qualitative filters \(Gates 1\2263\) precede financial analysis \(Gate 4\), which precedes) Tj T* (adversarial testing \(Gate 5\), which precedes valuation \(Gates 6 and 8\). Position sizing and monitoring \(Gate 7\) is) Tj T* (an ongoing process that follows entry and governs the conditions for exit.) Tj T* ET
