BT 1 0 0 1 0 61 Tm /F1 9 Tf 14 TL 18 0 Td (The framework is designed for the evaluation of publicly traded businesses with at least eight consecutive) Tj T* -18 0 Td (quarters of primary source financial data available. It is not designed for early-stage companies, businesses) Tj T* (without established earnings, or situations where primary source filings are unavailable or unreliable. The) Tj T* (framework does not guarantee outcomes. It is an explicit acknowledgment of the investor's own fallibility \227 each) Tj T* (gate is a structured attempt to identify and quantify the ways in which an analysis could be wrong.) Tj T* ET
