BT 1 0 0 1 0 61 Tm /F1 9 Tf 14 TL 18 0 Td (A business that passes all eight gates at a price that provides an adequate margin of safety represents a) Tj T* -18 0 Td (probable mispriced bet \227 a situation in which the market price implies assumptions that are more pessimistic than) Tj T* (the available primary source evidence supports. The framework does not predict that the price will converge to) Tj T* (intrinsic value within any specific timeframe. It holds that time, applied to a business with a genuine durable) Tj T* (competitive advantage, is itself a compounding force. \(Buffett, 1989\).) Tj T* ET
